    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "71af329d34e66888",
      "translationZh": "精选 AoTI Spaces",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c4fc82bc04b73449",
      "translationZh": "区域编译",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27a961cffd2473a0",
      "translationZh": "区域编译实践方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f49c2eba418afa62",
      "translationZh": "结合 AOT 的区域编译",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3a3d91e9b140d58",
      "translationZh": "在 Diffusers 中原生集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e73dd15aee5ac934",
      "translationZh": "更多性能数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c5bd4517ea96607",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Spaces 中的 ZeroGPU 是一项强大的功能，它通过提供强大的计算资源来赋能 AI 开发者。在本文中，我们展示了用户如何利用 PyTorch 的提前编译技术，加速使用 ZeroGPU 的应用程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48f1cf9000dd21e7",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 Flux.1-Dev 展示了加速效果，但这些技术并不仅限于这一模型。因此，我们鼓励你尝试这些技术，并在本次社区讨论中向我们提供反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4afe014f59a8af75",
      "translationZh": "访问我们在 Hub 上的 ZeroGPU-AOTI 组织，查看一系列运用了本文所讨论技术的演示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
